WEBVTT

00:44:59.349 --> 00:45:02.681
and then you talk to that person
and they actually care really deeply.

00:45:02.705 --> 00:45:06.060
CA: Yeah. "No, no -- that was
actually introvert speak for 'Awesome!'"

00:45:06.084 --> 00:45:07.234
SC: Yeah. Yeah.

00:45:07.258 --> 00:45:10.570
CA: Wow. Well, this has been
quite a conversation.

00:45:10.594 --> 00:45:17.548
I'd love to end -- maybe, you know,
say one parting thought for an introvert

00:45:17.572 --> 00:45:20.308
and one parting thought for an extrovert.

00:45:20.332 --> 00:45:23.684
SC: For an introvert, I guess
I would leave off where we began,

00:45:23.708 --> 00:45:29.804
which is that I hope you'll really embrace
the permission to be your full self,

00:45:29.828 --> 00:45:32.986
and that the more you do,
the more amazed you will be